WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:00.960
- So Margot, is it true

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:02.790
that you had a sleepover
like before the cast,

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:03.623
before the movie?

00:00:03.623 --> 00:00:04.950
- We had a Barbie sleepover.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:07.770
It was as fun as it sounds.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:08.927
- As it sounds. Yeah. It was--

00:00:08.927 --> 00:00:10.110
- It was Greta's idea.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.520
- Yeah, it was Greta's idea.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:12.960
I can't take credit.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.250
We all went to like Claridge's

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.310
which is a really
gorgeous hotel in London.

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:20.340
We all like shared beds
and like wore our pajamas

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:23.700
and ordered room service
and played games and found

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.876
out that America is like
exceptionally competitive.

00:00:26.876 --> 00:00:27.709
(audience laughs)

00:00:27.709 --> 00:00:30.390
- I am extremely competitive
and nobody told me

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:32.430
that it was a sexy Barbie sleepover.

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:35.370
So everybody was in like
really pretty silky nightgowns

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:39.300
and I was in like the most
grandma floral twin set

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.170
you could imagine.

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:42.330
- She somehow simultaneously
looked like an old lady,

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:43.830
but a five year old at the same time.

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:45.240
It was the cutest.

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:46.110
And she's so teen.

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:47.370
- While she's yelling at you during day.

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:48.660
- Yeah. While she's screaming at you.

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:50.610
But it was very, it was so charming.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:52.710
I mean, she was like
these cutest little thing.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:54.870
You'd put like a toddler in
to go to bed and then she was

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:57.030
like rousing at us for not
knowing the rules. It was--

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.650
- If you're not gonna play--

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:00.960
- If you're not gonna
compete, why are you here?

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.093
- If you're not gonna do, like why play?

